{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>whoever has a blemish shall not come near.</b> It is astonishing: why do we require in tractate Kiddushin the verse ״הנני נותן לו את בריתי שלום״ — to mean when he is whole and not when he is lacking? Let him derive it from here! And it requires investigation."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {0 "The reference to tractate Kiddushin is to a discussion there that derives the disqualification of a priest with a blemish from the verse about the covenant of peace; the note questions why that verse is needed when our verse here already states the disqualification."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:21.478230918Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}